      "mergeID": "5bf331be663c304fd7253f8b",
      "mergedPostDetails": "When VRChat starts in VR mode you can't move the character with the mouse anyway, and its pretty annoying, if I want to switch to another window on my secondary monitor. You could still control the menu with the mouse, just that the mouse is always locked and you have to alt-tab out of it is pretty annoying. Maybe for non controller people it may be useful - so make it a setting?",
